  "summary": "Taurus guidance for July 27, 2026 highlights heightened intuition in relationships, advising clear boundaries alongside nurture. Trust first impressions and instincts, as they may lead to breakthroughs. Spend time in nature or near water to ground yourself, and remain open to spiritual assistance.",
  "content": "Your intuitive approach to your relationships this week is your main theme.Taurus, sure, draw boundaries wherever necessary but also remember to nurture them where needed. You have this wonderful ability to sense vibes even before they surface and this week that ability peaks, allowing you to glimpse what you are capable of and what is in store for you. You not only discern what is meant for you but you also sum up people, situations and opportunities with a remarkably accurate first impression, so pay attention to those instincts. Your ideas will lead you to some breakthrough moments\u2014listen to them. Spend time in nature or near water, or listen to nature sounds to ground your energy.\n\nCosmic tip:Your guardian angels are working especially closely with you this week. Grant them permission to assist you.\n\nAries July 27, 2026\n\nGemini July 27, 2026\n\nCancer July 27, 2026\n\nLeo July 27, 2026\n\nLibra July 27, 2026\n\nScorpio July 27, 2026\n\nVirgo July 27, 2026\n\nSagittarius July 27, 2026\n\nCapricorn July 27, 2026\n\nAquarius July 27, 2026\n\nPisces July 27, 2026\n\nSee more stories\n\nCond\u00e9 Nast India\n\n\u00a9 2026 Cond\u00e9 Nast. All rights reserved. Use of this website constitutes acceptance of ourTerms of ServiceandPolicy and Cookie Statement. The material on this site may not be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, cached or otherwise used, except with the prior written permission of Cond\u00e9 Nast.",
