  "markdown_content": "## Taurus\\n\\nYour intuitive approach to your relationships this week is your main theme. Taurus, sure, draw boundaries wherever necessary but also remember to nurture them where needed. You have this wonderful ability to sense vibes even before they surface and this week that ability peaks, allowing you to glimpse what you are capable of and what is in store for you. You not only discern what is meant for you but you also sum up people, situations and opportunities with a remarkably accurate first impression, so pay attention to those instincts. Your ideas will lead you to some breakthrough moments\u2014listen to them. Spend time in nature or near water, or listen to nature sounds to ground your energy.\\n\\n## Cosmic tip\\n\\nYour guardian angels are working especially closely with you this week. Grant them permission to assist you.\\n\\n## Other signs\\n\\n- Aries July 27, 2026\\n- Gemini July 27, 2026\\n- Cancer July 27, 2026\\n- Leo July 27, 2026\\n- Libra July 27, 2026\\n- Scorpio July 27, 2026\\n- Virgo July 27, 2026\\n- Sagittarius July 27, 2026\\n- Capricorn July 27, 2026\\n- Aquarius July 27, 2026\\n- Pisces July 27, 2026\\n\\n## See more stories\\n\\nCond\u00e9 Nast India\\n\\n\u00a9 2026 Cond\u00e9 Nast. All rights reserved. Use of this website constitutes acceptance of ourTerms of ServiceandPolicy and Cookie Statement. The material on this site may not be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, cached or otherwise used, except with the prior written permission of Cond\u00e9 Nast.",
